  _key: DIALOGUE_SERAPHINE_NODE_Q1_ACCEPTED
  _displayName: 
  _description: 
  _speakerName: Seraphine
  _dialogueText: 'Then the Torch is yours.

    Carry it to the Forgotten Sanctum
    and seek the ancient lanterns. Their flames will reveal the path to Gor''Vakh.

    Remember,
    defeating him is not your only purpose. Search for the relic he guards.

    Return
    to me when you have found it. And traveller... do not let your own flame fade.'
  _choices:
  - _choiceText: I'll return with the relic.
